atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012320/extras/cc98ff45105a93a302aa7f7ceea989d5.poster.avif?t=1749118104\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012320/extras/cc98ff45105a93a302aa7f7ceea989d5.webm?t=1749118104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2012320/extras/cc98ff45105a93a302aa7f7ceea989d5.mp4?t=1749118104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Parallel Experiment</strong> has a variety of mind-twisting challenges that push the boundaries of cooperative puzzle design, offering situations never seen before in other games.</p>",
